# Scratch appetize.io build extraction/repackaging, never a project artifact.
# Wildcarded since a new numbered dir gets created each retest cycle -
# .appetize-build/ and .appetize-build2/ alone missed .appetize-build3/ and
# .appetize-build4/, which sat untracked instead of ignored.
.appetize-build*/
.appetize-evidence/

